        "provenance": {
          "source": "legacy_db_data",
          "method": "copied from legacy ItemTexts.Description"
        }
      },
      "location": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "Fog Rift Catacombs : Near the end of the dungeon, guarded by a Black Knight. [ See Shadow of the Erdtree Map ] [ Video Link ]; Scorpion River Catacombs : Shortly after the first elevator down, take the ladder down to the right of the Yellow Fulgurbloom and the Ghost Glovewort [7] . On the lower ground there are three Basilisks; crouch-walk or use the Beast-Repellent Torchto not alert them as you collect the item. [ See Shadow of the Erdtree Map ] [ Video Link ]; Darklight Catacombs : Dropped from the giant Bigmouth Imp standing on a platform in the big hall after taking the second elevator down. [ See Shadow of the Erdtree Map ] [ Video Location ]",
        "provenance": {
          "source": "legacy_db_data",
          "method": "copied from legacy ItemTexts.Location"
        }
